Falsifies `system_tests::user::process_tests::a_destroyed_region_ends_the_process_in_it_and_its_members`.

Architecture: aarch64, riscv64, x86_64

The defect, in milestone 812 (`std::thread::spawn` runs real threads in one address space)'s process object: destroying the region a process lives in no longer ends
the process, so a member whose TCB is elsewhere runs on and keeps the process's page.

Expected to fail: "the retry never reclaimed the process's region".

